# PHPUnit 10 conventions

- Tests at `<slug>/tests/<Class>Test.php`, namespace `<NS>\<Sub>\Tests\…`.
- `bootstrap="vendor/autoload.php"`, `failOnWarning="true"`, `cacheDirectory=".phpunit.cache"` (see `candy-core/phpunit.xml`). Every public method ≥1 test.
- **Loop-pinning bootstrap** — a suite bounding waits with timers on the shared `Loop::get()` uses `bootstrap="tests/bootstrap.php"` + `\SugarCraft\Testing\LoopPin::pinStableClock()` (`candy-async`, `candy-mosaic`, `candy-pty`, `candy-testing`, `sugar-crush`). ext-uv computes deadlines against a clock refreshed once per loop iteration, so a timer armed after synchronous idle fires immediately; `StreamSelectLoop` refreshes at arm time. See `candy-testing/src/LoopPin.php` and `candy-core/src/Program.php`.

Patterns (`sugar-bits/tests/`, `candy-core/tests/`, `candy-vt/tests/`):
- **Snapshot byte** — assert raw `\x1b[1m`-style SGR strings from `view()`. Don't abstract.
- **Golden render** — `<slug>/tests/GoldenRenderTest.php` asserts byte-exact `view()`/`render()` output against committed `<slug>/tests/fixtures/*.golden` files via `SugarCraft\Testing\Snapshot\Assertions::assertGoldenAnsi($path, $output)`. Needs `sugarcraft/candy-testing` dev-dep only — CI injects the path repos (canonical `sugar-charts/tests/GoldenRenderTest.php`).
- **Snapshot cell-grid** — drive through `SugarCraft\Vt\Terminal\Terminal`, assert `$term->screen()->cell($r,$c)` (`$screen->cols`/`rows` are properties).
- **Behaviour** — drive `update()` with scripted `KeyMsg`/`MouseMsg`, assert `[Model, ?Cmd]`.
- **Coercion** — negative/oversized index, empty, null; assert clamp/no-op.
- **Cross-lib parity** — `candy-vcr/tests/VtParityTest.php` diffs the `candy-vcr` renderer against `candy-vt` and must pass against BOTH the linked monorepo `candy-vt` and the stale Packagist `dev-master` CI resolves. Gate version-dependent arms on a feature marker (`Scrollback::clear()`) via the `vtCarriesMarker()` helper — a literal `\method_exists()` constant-folds under PHPStan into an always-true/always-false report.
- **Documentation drift** — `sugar-crush/tests/Config/ReadmeRosterDriftTest.php`, `EnvRosterDriftTest.php`, `TrustKeyDocumentationDriftTest.php`, `sugar-crush/tests/Commands/KeyBindingDriftTest.php` re-derive `sugar-crush/README.md` + `sugar-crush/docs/*.md` rosters from `sugar-crush/src/`. New tool/command/env var/key binding without the doc edit = red.

**Stream-write gotcha**: don't `ftruncate; rewind;` between writes. Slice deltas with `ftell`/`fseek`/`stream_get_contents` (canonical `candy-core/tests/RendererTest.php`).

**FFI** (`candy-pty/tests/`): structural tests run unconditionally; syscall round-trips call `requirePtySyscalls()` first.

**Hang watchdog** (`candy-pty/tests/`): `tests/bootstrap.php` calls `HangWatchdog::install()` AFTER `LoopPin::pinStableClock()`; `candy-pty/tests/Support/hang-watchdog.php` bounds each test out-of-process and SIGKILLs the runner with a forensic dump. `candy-pty/tests/Support/SharedLoopResidue.php` throws on anything left armed on the shared `Loop::get()`.

Run: `cd <slug> && composer install && vendor/bin/phpunit`. Check vendor wiring with `php scripts/refresh-deps.php --status`.
